==English==
{{wikipedia}}
[[Image:Nervous system diagram.png|thumb|An overview of the human nervous system.]]
===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[nervous]] [[system]]}}

# {{neuroanatomy}} An organ system that coordinates the activities of muscles, monitors organs, constructs and processes data received from the senses, and initiates actions. In [[vertebrate]]s it consists of the [[brain]], the [[brainstem]], the [[spinal cord]], [[nerve]]s, and [[ganglion|ganglia]].

====Synonyms====
* [[systema nervosum]]

====Derived terms====
* [[autonomic nervous system]]
* [[central nervous system]]
* [[peripheral nervous system]]

